ick\u00e9 zobrazov\u00e1n\u00ed<\/strong> a odhaluj\u00ed skryt\u00e9 informace o materi\u00e1lov\u00fdch struktur\u00e1ch.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"792\">Z webin\u00e1\u0159e si odnesete:<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"863\">osv\u011bd\u010den\u00e9 postupy \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed probl\u00e9m\u016f v oblasti materi\u00e1lov\u00e9ho v\u00fdzkumu,<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"911\">konkr\u00e9tn\u00ed p\u0159\u00edklady pou\u017eit\u00ed a nam\u011b\u0159en\u00e1 data,<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"960\">praktick\u00e9 tipy vyu\u017eiteln\u00e9 ve v\u011bd\u011b i v QA\/QC.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1229\">Tento webin\u00e1\u0159 je ur\u010den v\u0161em v\u011bdc\u016fm, v\u00fdzkumn\u00edk\u016fm a profesion\u00e1l\u016fm v oblasti kontroly kvality, kte\u0159\u00ed cht\u011bj\u00ed z\u00edskat hlub\u0161\u00ed vhled do <strong data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1135\">struktury a chov\u00e1n\u00ed pokro\u010dil\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f<\/strong>. Pod\u00edvejte se na n\u011bj kdykoli a objevte, jak Ramanova spektroskopie posouv\u00e1 hranice pozn\u00e1n\u00ed! <a href=\"https:\/\/www.thermofisher.com\/in\/en\/home\/global\/forms\/industrial\/mcs-vib-raman-revolution-on-demand-webinar.html?tracksrc=IntEm-Button1-1995375&amp;leadsource=Email&amp;C_Campaign_Element=7014z000001pry5AAA&amp;elqTrackId=d982881664a74beb9724b00bd7f85565&amp;elq=ee4731a1d3784ba3b645917da37391bc&amp;elqaid=7076&amp;elqat=1&amp;elqCampaignId=2798&amp;elqak=8AF5483B834E9EB5F738BC29749C06EF0C516DA3AA076D7FB5C59CF4326182754F61\"><strong>Vy\u017e\u00e1dat si jej m\u016f\u017eete zde<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Pokro\u010dil\u00e9 materi\u00e1ly, jako jsou nap\u0159\u00edklad polovodi\u010de nebo grafen, p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161ej\u00ed nov\u00e9 mo\u017enosti \u2013 ale tak\u00e9 nov\u00e9 v\u00fdzvy p\u0159i jejich v\u00fdzkumu a kontrole kvality. Chcete je rychle a spole